    dct:relation [ dct:description "The ETSI TR 103 290 specification focuses on ensuring that data generated across diverse platforms can be collected, transmitted, and processed effectively, enabling interoperability and meaningful use of the information. In this sense, it provides guidance on how data exchange should be handled to support Smart City applications."@en ;
